        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eirorie Yoshua iltung'ana te Shekem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua aiturrur iloshon pooki le Israel te Shekem, neipotu ilpayiani, ilukuny oo nkajijik, o larishak o lkituaak le Israel, neyau ninche ate dukuya Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 11.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Yoshua lelo tung'ana pooki, “Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, ‘Etamanya apa loo papaai linyi lido kekun Frati, Tera menye le Abraham o Nahori; neisiaai ninche kulie aitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.1+GEN.12.2+GEN.12.3+GEN.12.4+GEN.12.5+GEN.12.6+GEN.12.7+GEN.12.8+GEN.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1+GEN.21.2+GEN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naya apa nanu papaai linyi Abraham aitayu te lido kekun olkeju narik nanu ninye ti atua enkop e Kanaan pooki; naitubul eishoi enye aitaa kumok. Aishoo nanu ninye Isaak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.24+GEN.25.25+GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 25.24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naisho Isaak Yakobo o Esau. Naisho nanu Esau ina kop oo ldoinyo e Seir meitaa enenye, kake eshomo Yakobo o nkera enyena Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ena 3.1–12.42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nairriwaa nanu Musa o Aron, naar nanu enkop e Misiri te nena nataasa nanu ti atua ninche; ore te siadi naipang'unye nanu intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 14.1-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naipang'unye nanu loo papaai linyi aitung'uaa Misiri, nipuonunu enaiposha; nesuju apa Ilmisiri loo papaai linyi too ngarrin o too mbartan o meetu Enaiposha Nanyokie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eishiraki ninche Olaitoriani nepik ninye enaimin erishata intae o lelo Misiri, naisho enaiposha meeu shumata ninche neitemoo ninche; netoduaa nkonyek inyi enaitaasa nanu Misiri; nitotoni intae to lpurkel enkata naado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naitoki nanu ayau intae enkop oo Lamori, laa ninche apa ootii lido likae kekun le Yordan; nearare ninche intae, naishoru nanu ninche apik atua nkaik inyi, niyaya intae enkop enye aaitaa eninyi, naidaikie nanu ninche te dukuya intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Enki 22.1–24.25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki adumunye Balak olayioni le Sipor, olaiguanani le Moab, nearare Israel; neirriwaa olkilikuai aitoomon Balaam olayioni le Beor meeu adek intae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake eitu nanu aning Balaam; neaku etamayiana ninye intae; neaku atokordua nanu intae aitung'uaa enkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.3.14+JOS.3.15+JOS.3.16+JOS.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 3.14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.1+JOS.6.2+JOS.6.3+JOS.6.4+JOS.6.5+JOS.6.6+JOS.6.7+JOS.6.8+JOS.6.9+JOS.6.10+JOS.6.11+JOS.6.12+JOS.6.13+JOS.6.14+JOS.6.15+JOS.6.16+JOS.6.17+JOS.6.18+JOS.6.19+JOS.6.20+JOS.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.1-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nitalang'utua apa intae Yordan nipuonunu Yeriko, nearare intae iltung'ana le Yeriko, o Lamori sii, o Lperisi o Lkanaan, o Lhiti, o Lgigashi o Lhifi, o Lyebusi; naishoru nanu ninche apik atua nkaik inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 23.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 7.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Napik nanu enkuretisho dukuya intae naa enkaraki ena apa mme olalem linyi neme enkawuo inyi, natimirayie lelo aiguanak oare loo Lamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.10+DEU.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 6.10-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aishoo nanu intae enkop neitu iekarere, o nkanas neitu ishetishete, nibikitoto intae ti atua ninche ninyanya ilng'anayio le nkurma o sabibu leitu iunuunu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore naa taata entureita Olaitoriani nisiayiayia ninye to ltau owang o te sipata (metii esunkureisho); ewuang'ie nena aitin apa naaisiaayia iloo papaai linyi te lido kekun Yordan; o te Misiri nisiayiayia Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ti nimiyieuu intae nisiayiayia Olaitoriani, entegelu ena olong olisiayiayia tenaa ai nena aitin apa naaisiaayia iloo papaai linyi te lido kekun Yordan aashu tenaa ai nena aitin oo Lamori naa enkop enye itii; kake ore nanu o olmarei lai naa aikisiaai Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal iltung'ana aajo, “Kilome miking'uaa iyiook Olaitoriani, aapuo aaisiai kulie aitin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu Olaitoriani Enkai ang apa oyaua iyiook o loo papa aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri, aitupuku te nkaji e sinkaisho, naa ninye apa otaasa nena kitoduaat sapuki too nkonyek ang, negolie iyiook te ina oitoi pooki apa nikiima o ti atua iltung'ana pooki apa likiimaitie atua ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nearaa Olaitoriani te dukuya iyiook iloreren pooki, Ilamori apa laa ninche emanya ena kop; metaa eikisiai sii iyiook Olaitoriani, amu ninye Enkai ang.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
